1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,060
490 million soums a month.

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,650
No experience needed.

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,760
Would you apply?

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,330
The post says:

5
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:16,560
Claude is inviting people to remote work, applications until November 22, the task is to get around artificial intelligence.

6
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,860
I, Claude, checked it myself.

7
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,880
No such vacancy was found.

8
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,860
But the basis is real:

9
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,880
Anthropic has a safety program.

10
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:32,440
Researchers find a weak spot in Claude's protection, quietly report it to the company and get a reward.

11
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,080
It is not a salary.

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:43,050
It is a reward for each flaw found, at most about thirty-five thousand dollars.

13
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:45,030
And it is not \u201cno experience\u201d either:

14
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:47,980
finding a new flaw takes deep knowledge.

15
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:51,490
The post itself prefers engineers and scientists.

16
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,330
Red flags:

17
00:00:53,330 --> 00:01:01,660
no source, no link, a \u201churry up\u201d deadline, and a \u201cyou know who to send it to\u201d click trap.

18
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:09,430
Scammers use exactly such an ad to ask for a passport, a card and a verification code, or to take money in advance.

19
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:11,340
Three rules.

20
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:16,970
Check a vacancy only on the company's official site.

21
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:21,760
An employer never asks for money, a card or a code in advance.

22
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,450
If someone rushes you, stop.

23
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:25,010
Every time, ask:

24
00:01:25,010 --> 00:01:27,140
who profits from this?

25
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:31,990
Send a suspicious post or job text to our bot:

26
00:01:31,990 --> 00:01:33,080
@sahiychishopbot.

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:38,090
It finds the red flags and teaches you step by step how to check.

